  "label": "Quran as Religious Text",
  "description": "The Quran is the central religious text of Islam, and studying it is a core religious practice for Muslims. The image depicts boys engaged in this legitimate religious activity. However, the meme uses this to imply that such religious practice is threatening or incompatible with Western values — a distortion that requires external knowledge of Islamic practices to understand the harmful intent.",
